# Scripts structure (rust-first)

Product automation is **Rust**: `src/boxes/xtask.rs` + `src/bin/gsv_xtask.rs` (`cargo xtask`). Long-running daemons stay dedicated bins (`gsv-live`, `gsv-watchdog`, `gsv-server`).

```
src/bin/          cargo run --bin …  and cargo xtask
benches/          cargo bench --bench gsv_dev
tests/            cargo test
scripts/          README only (no new .sh / .ps1)
bin/              empty of product wrappers
```

Never add `.ps1`. Never add `.sh` for tests, benches, or kit scripts. See [`docs/gsv/GSV_RUST_DEV.md`](../../docs/gsv/GSV_RUST_DEV.md).
